stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PrivateSession: Open workspace
    Reviewing --> SavedOnDevice: Type subject or message
    SavedOnDevice --> SavedOnDevice: Keep typing, including offline
    SavedOnDevice --> Restored: Reload and open same reply
    SavedOnDevice --> ChangedElsewhere: Reload after saved version or recipients change
    ChangedElsewhere --> Restored: Review updated draft, keeping recovered text
    SavedOnDevice --> Reviewing: Discard device draft, announce saved text
    Restored --> Reviewing: Discard device draft, announce saved text
    ChangedElsewhere --> Reviewing: Discard device draft, announce saved text
    SavedOnDevice --> Saving: Save draft
    Restored --> Saving: Save draft
    Saving --> Reviewing: Server confirms exact saved text, clear matching snapshot
    Saving --> NewerLocalEdit: Another tab persists newer text or ordered To or Cc
    NewerLocalEdit --> NewerLocalEdit: Old save receipt arrives, keep newer device draft
    NewerLocalEdit --> ChangedElsewhere: Reload and open preserved draft
    NewerLocalEdit --> Reviewing: Explicitly discard device draft
    Saving --> ChangedElsewhere: Version conflict
    Saving --> SaveUnknown: Outcome unknown, editing locked
    SaveUnknown --> Saving: Check outcome with original request
    SavedOnDevice --> Grace: Submit
    Restored --> Grace: Submit
    Grace --> Restored: Undo or leave page, keep reviewed text
    Grace --> Submitting: Grace expires
    Submitting --> Queued: Server confirms queued reply, clear matching snapshot
    Submitting --> SubmitUnknown: Outcome unknown, editing locked
    SubmitUnknown --> Submitting: Check outcome with original request
    Submitting --> Restored: Refused, keep edited text
    SavedOnDevice --> MemoryOnly: Device storage fails
    MemoryOnly --> SavedOnDevice: Next edit persists
    state PrivateSession {
        [*] --> Reviewing: Open reply
        state Reviewing
        state SavedOnDevice
        state Restored
        state ChangedElsewhere
        state NewerLocalEdit
        state Saving
        state SaveUnknown
        state Grace
        state Submitting
        state SubmitUnknown
        state Queued
        state MemoryOnly
    }
    PrivateSession --> SignedOut: Session ends, clear private device storage
    SignedOut --> Reviewing: Same partner signs in, open server draft
    %% Recovery covers reload and page closure, but intentionally excludes sign-out and session revocation.
    %% never Reload, reconnect or restore sends email or submits a reply.
    %% never Another partner restores this partner's text.
    %% never Restoring old text silently adopts a newer version or recipients.
    %% never Session revocation retains private device drafts.
    %% Transition tests (titles in test/email-draft-save-browser.test.mjs unless qualified):
    %% Open/type/keep/reload: half-written reply survives reload without saving or submitting; offline typing restores after reconnect without replaying a command.
    %% Changed version/review/save/clear: restored text never silently adopts changed server version or recipients.
    %% All discard edges: discard announces saved text and retains keyboard focus at WIDTHpx conflict=CONFLICT.
    %% Ordinary save/clear: partner saves draft without sending at WIDTHpx THEME.
    %% Save conflict: draft version conflict preserves edits and requires reload without automatic retry.
    %% Storage fail/recover: page-only draft becomes saved on device when storage recovers.
    %% Session end/reopen: sign out clears device drafts even when the same partner signs in again; signed-out save refuses and clears private draft content.
    %% Recovered submit/clear: confirmed submission clears recovered snapshot conflict=CONFLICT.
    %% Grace undo/leave/expire: test/email-followups.test.mjs: Submit opens a 10 second send grace and Undo returns the edited draft without any server call; the send grace expiring submits exactly once with the key minted at Submit.
    %% Save unknown/replay: test/email-followups.test.mjs: uncertain draft save locks edits and Check outcome replays only the original save.
    %% Submit unknown/replay: test/email-followups.test.mjs: reply submission loss locks editing and Check outcome replays the exact request after removal from the list.
    %% Submit refused: test/email-followups.test.mjs: a refusal after the send grace is shown plainly with the edits kept.
    %% Cross-tab cleanup guard: reviewed recovery cleanup preserves newer typing from another tab.
    %% never A late receipt deletes a draft with newer text, version, or ordered To or Cc.
    %% Newer edit / late receipt / reload / discard: late save preserves FIELD-only edit at WIDTHpx THEME.
    %% Exact identity and order: test/reply-device-drafts.test.mjs: late receipt preserves changed FIELD; recipient order is part of the snapshot identity.
    %% Missing storage / repeat discard: test/reply-device-drafts.test.mjs: missing storage and explicit discard are repeat safe.
